{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36424","headline":"曲江春望 · 罗邺","name":"曲江春望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故国东归泽国遥，曲江晴望忆渔樵。\n都缘北阙春先到，不是南山雪易消。\n瑞影玉楼开组绣，欢声丹禁奏云韶。\n虽然未得陪鸳鹭，亦酹金觞祝帝尧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}